    <h2 class="section-title">How Currently Not Collectible Status Works for Construction Contractors</h2>
    <div class="qualify-grid">
      <div class="qualify-card yes">
        <div class="qualify-header">
          <h3>CNC Benefits for Construction Contractors:</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>No monthly payments required at all</li>
          <li>Wage garnishments and levies stop</li>
          <li>Time to recover from financial hardship</li>
          <li>Collection statute keeps running (debt may expire)</li>
          <li>Can pursue other options later when stable</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="qualify-card yes">
        <div class="qualify-header">
          <h3>What You'll Need:</h3>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>All tax returns filed</li>
          <li>Proof of financial hardship</li>
          <li>Income and expense documentation</li>
          <li>Show zero or negative disposable income</li>
          <li>No application fee required</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
